---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Occult History: Ritual Frequency & Western Transmission | Hub VI"
  description="The technology of ritual frequency. Trace the documentary lineage of Western esotericism, from John Dee’s Enochian operations to the Hermetic Order of the Golden Dawn."
>
  <main class="site-wrapper section theme-denying" style="padding-top: 40px;">
      
    <!-- WAYFINDING CONDUIT -->
    <nav class="shsq-wayfinding-conduit reveal" aria-label="Hub Navigation" style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto 50px auto; padding: 0 20px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px;">
      <ul class="breadcrumb-trail" style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; gap: 10px; font-family: var(--font-display); text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.85rem;">
        <li><a href="/the-escape-matrix/">&#8629; Master Grid</a></li>
        <li class="separator" aria-hidden="true" style="color: var(--shsq-muted);">/</li>
        <li class="current-node" aria-current="page" style="color: var(--shsq-parchment);">Hub VI: Occult History</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="adjacent-node">
        <a href="/eastern-sciences/" style="color: #C97A6A; font-family: var(--font-display); text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.85rem; letter-spacing: 1px; border-bottom: 1px solid #C97A6A; padding-bottom: 2px;">Engage Hub VII &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- HUB HERO -->
    <header class="shsq-hub-hero reveal" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 60px; max-width: 1200px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; padding: 0 20px;">
      <span class="archive-eyebrow" style="color: var(--shsq-silver); font-size: 0.95rem; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; display: block; margin-bottom: 15px;">Hub VI &middot; The Holy-Denying Force</span>
      <h1 style="color: #C97A6A; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem); margin: 0 0 25px 0; line-height: 1.1;">Occult History</h1>
      <p style="color: var(--shsq-parchment); font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.8; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
        The technology of ritual frequency. Trace the documentary lineage of Western esotericism, from John Dee’s Enochian operations to the Rosicrucian Manifestos and the Hermetic Order of the Golden Dawn. Uncover primary-source research revealing that ceremonial magic is not arbitrary superstition, but highly structured psychological technology designed to forcefully weaponize the subconscious and bypass the structural resistance of the material simulation.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- PILLAR CLUSTER GRID (6 NODES) -->
    <div class="shsq-cluster-grid reveal reveal-delay-1" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 30px; margin-bottom: 80px; max-width: 1200px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; padding: 0 20px;">
        
      <!-- Pillar 1 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="border: 1px solid rgba(201, 122, 106, 0.3); border-top: 4px solid #C97A6A; background: rgba(201, 122, 106, 0.05); display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow">Pillar 1: Elizabethan Magic</span>
        <h3 style="color: #C97A6A; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px;">The Foundation of Enochian Magic</h3>
        <p style="flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 35px;">
          Examine the primary-source diaries of Dr. John Dee and Edward Kelley, charting the 16th-century visionary operations that generated the complex Enochian system of angelical communication.
        </p>
        <a href="/occult-history/john-dee-enochian-magic/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="color: #C97A6A; border-color: #C97A6A; align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- Pillar 2 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="border: 1px solid rgba(201, 122, 106, 0.3); border-top: 4px solid #C97A6A; background: rgba(201, 122, 106, 0.05); display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow">Pillar 2: 17th Century Esotericism</span>
        <h3 style="color: #C97A6A; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px;">The Rosicrucian Manifestos</h3>
        <p style="flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 35px;">
          Analyze the Fama Fraternitatis and Chymical Wedding, tracing the emergence of a secret brotherhood promising global spiritual reformation based on Hermetic, Alchemical, and Qabalistic principles.
        </p>
        <a href="/occult-history/rosicrucian-manifestos/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="color: #C97A6A; border-color: #C97A6A; align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- Pillar 3 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="border: 1px solid rgba(201, 122, 106, 0.3); border-top: 4px solid #C97A6A; background: rgba(201, 122, 106, 0.05); display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow">Pillar 3: The Hermetic Revival</span>
        <h3 style="color: #C97A6A; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px;">The Golden Dawn</h3>
        <p style="flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 35px;">
          Uncover the origins of the Isis-Urania Temple, exploring how deciphered Cipher Manuscripts birthed a structural organization dedicated to Occult Science and the Magic of Hermes.
        </p>
        <a href="/occult-history/golden-dawn-cipher-manuscripts/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="color: #C97A6A; border-color: #C97A6A; align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- Pillar 4 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="border: 1px solid rgba(201, 122, 106, 0.3); border-top: 4px solid #C97A6A; background: rgba(201, 122, 106, 0.05); display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow">Pillar 4: System Integration</span>
        <h3 style="color: #C97A6A; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px;">Enochian Mechanics Synthesis</h3>
        <p style="flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 35px;">
          Discover how MacGregor Mathers extracted Dee's Forty-Eight Calls and fused them with Qabalah and Tarot, transforming raw visionary data into a highly effective psychological field of operation.
        </p>
        <a href="/occult-history/enochian-mechanics-synthesis/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="color: #C97A6A; border-color: #C97A6A; align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- Pillar 5 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="border: 1px solid rgba(201, 122, 106, 0.3); border-top: 4px solid #C97A6A; background: rgba(201, 122, 106, 0.05); display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow">Pillar 5: Ritual Engineering</span>
        <h3 style="color: #C97A6A; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px;">Mechanics of Ceremonial Magic</h3>
        <p style="flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 35px;">
          Investigate the systematic stimulation of the physical senses as defined by Golden Dawn initiates, framing ritual as a mechanism of profound psychological "gearing" to harness subconscious forces.
        </p>
        <a href="/occult-history/mechanics-of-ceremonial-magic/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="color: #C97A6A; border-color: #C97A6A; align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- Pillar 6 -->
      <article class="shsq-cluster-card" style="border: 1px solid rgba(201, 122, 106, 0.3); border-top: 4px solid #C97A6A; background: rgba(201, 122, 106, 0.05); display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span class="silo-eyebrow">Pillar 6: Vibratory Physics</span>
        <h3 style="color: #C97A6A; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 20px;">Active &amp; Passive Symbolism</h3>
        <p style="flex-grow: 1; margin-bottom: 35px;">
          Deconstruct the functions of sacred geometry, vibratory invocations, and frequency to understand the structural technology used to actively thin the barrier of matter and contact higher consciousness.
        </p>
        <a href="/occult-history/active-passive-symbolism/" class="btn btn-ghost" style="color: #C97A6A; border-color: #C97A6A; align-self: flex-start;">
          Enter the Source &rarr;
        </a>
      </article>

    </div>

    <!-- TERMINAL PROMPT -->
    <aside class="shsq-terminal-prompt reveal" aria-labelledby="terminal-heading" style="border: 1px solid #C97A6A; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto 80px auto; text-align: center;">
      <h2 id="terminal-heading" style="color: #C97A6A;">The Historical Grid is Locked</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--shsq-parchment); font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 40px; max-width: 700px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
        The timeline of the Western Esoteric transmission has been mapped. The rituals have been exposed as psychological algorithms. You must now integrate these mechanics into the final operational Hub.
      </p>
      <a href="/eastern-sciences/" class="btn btn-primary" style="background: #C97A6A; border-color: #C97A6A;">
        Engage Hub VII &#8599;
      </a>
    </aside>

    <footer class="shsq-footer-note reveal reveal-delay-2" style="text-align: center; color: var(--shsq-silver); font-size: 0.85rem; font-style: italic; border-top: 1px solid rgba(201, 122, 106, 0.2); padding-top: 30px; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px;">
      <p style="margin: 0;">History SQ: Decoding the Enneagrammatic Escape Plan &middot; Guided by Sophia Mysterion.</p>
    </footer>

  </main>
</Layout>